#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry classical_sets. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit. Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Local Open Scope ring_scope. Section Circle_Chord_Theorem. Variable R : realType. Variables (O A B C D E : 'rV[R]_2). Hypotheses (circ : forall P : 'rV[R]_2, P \in [set A; C; D; E] -> norm (P - O) = norm (A - O)) (A_neq_B : A != B) (B_neq_E : B != E) (C_neq_D : C != D) (B_on_AE : exists t1 : R, 0 < t1 < 1 /\ B = (1 - t1) *: A + t1 *: E) (B_on_AD : exists t2 : R, 0 < t2 < 1 /\ B = (1 - t2) *: A + t2 *: D) (B_on_BC : exists t3 : R, 0 < t3 < 1 /\ B = (1 - t3) *: D + t3 *: C) (AB_eq_5 : norm (B - A) = 5) (BE_eq_x : exists x : R, norm (B - E) = x). Variable x. Lemma chord_ratio : x * x = 25. Proof. move: AB_eq_5; rewrite -natrM -natrX -natrX => /(_ _ _). by []. Qed. End Section Circle_Chord_Theorem.
